# NOTE (draft): the author list below is copied from the genotyping workflow as a
# starting point, since these workflows share the same lab and manuscript. It MUST
# be reviewed for imputation-specific contributors before release. The upstream
# method (see the README provenance section) originates with the Powell Lab /
# sceQTL-Gen consortium and is cited there rather than as authors of this repo.
# version, date-released and the Zenodo DOI are added at release time.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "imputation: a genotype QC and 1000 Genomes imputation Snakemake workflow"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow that takes measured genotypes (VCF) and performs quality
  control (SNP filtering, sex and ancestry checks against a 1000 Genomes
  reference) and imputation of missing variants against a 1000 Genomes reference
  panel, followed by filtering to produce SNP profiles suitable for
  single-cell demultiplexing with Demuxafy. Adapted from the Powell Lab /
  sceQTL-Gen consortium imputation pipeline.
type: software
